  !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
  SUSPICIOUSLY GOOD RESULTS — investigate before reporting:
    - every attack session detected -- a perfect rate is a leakage signal more often than a win, and hides which class is hardest
    - 100% detection at 0% false positives on the same split
    - no attack class is harder than any other -- check that the adversarial cases are still adversarial
